1250:- [高] [GRILL.md:22](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-raw-actionability-closure/GRILL.md:22)、[plan.md:25](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-raw-actionability-closure/plan.md:25)：D3 是明确的行为变更，却同时声称“不改 `raw-replay-runner` 判定语义”并用 G3 钉“缺省零行为差”。现役 driver 先 `.first()` 再 count，[raw-playwright-driver.mjs:45](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-playwright-driver.mjs:45)；共享门把 count=0/>1/1 分别解释为 none/ambiguous/unique，[action-authority.mjs:93](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/replay/action-authority.mjs:93)；runner 再映射为 `SELECTOR_NONE`/`SELECTOR_AMBIGUOUS`，[raw-replay-runner.mjs:145](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-replay-runner.mjs:145)。替换后至少三路改变：多可见由“可能点击首个并 CLEAN”变为零点击 ambiguous；首隐、唯一可见由 ACTION_FAILED 变为可能 CLEAN；全隐由 ACTION_FAILED 变为未定义的 hidden 路。且现役门与 runner 根本没有 `hidden` 表达。修法：补一张旧→新行为差表，明确 `visibleCount=0` 究竟映射 `none`、新稳定 reason，还是 `action_failed`；同步定义 `candidateCount` 在 v2 是否等于 `visibleCandidateCount`；把 G3 严格限定为“诊断关闭与 runtime 缺省参数零差”，不得覆盖 D3；金牌须贯穿 driver→action-authority→runner→proof，而非只测 resolver。
1252:- [高] [GRILL.md:14](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-raw-actionability-closure/GRILL.md:14)、[plan.md:9](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-raw-actionability-closure/plan.md:9)：D2/D4 没有可实现的逐事件诊断传输接缝。runner 把 seq 放成不可枚举属性，[raw-replay-runner.mjs:205](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-replay-runner.mjs:205)，共享门随即仅复制枚举键而丢掉 seq，[action-authority.mjs:24](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/replay/action-authority.mjs:24)；driver 的公开返回仍只有 `{ok,identityReadback}`，[raw-playwright-driver.mjs:151](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-playwright-driver.mjs:151)；`safeEmit` 又是只追加、不能补写既有事件，[cycle-evidence-context.mjs:203](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/cycle-evidence-context.mjs:203)。因此 catch 无法把跨 resolve/origin/revalidate/trial/click 累积出的字段送回“同一 seq 的单条边车记录”。修法：先契约化私有诊断上下文，例如 `withRawActionEvidence(seq, profile, body)` 加逐相位累积器、terminal 时由 runner 唯一 finalize；它不得进入 authority、动作返回值或正式产物。补并发双事件、首错、迟到通报、恰一 terminal 记录的测试。
1256:- [高] [GRILL.md:40](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-raw-actionability-closure/GRILL.md:40)、[plan.md:17](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-raw-actionability-closure/plan.md:17)：D5 当前不可完整执行。计划只设计 `--viewport`/`--headed`，[plan.md:19](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-raw-actionability-closure/plan.md:19)，没有 E-D 所需的 app-ready/trial timeout 注入口；现 CLI 也只接受 case/capture/sut/out，[teachin-raw-replay.mjs:28](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/bin/teachin-raw-replay.mjs:28)。若为分类而在缺省路径先跑 `trial:true`，它会额外等待 actionability，已改变时序和控制流，与 D2/G3 冲突。修法：新增闭合 `diagnosticProfile`，至少含 viewport、headless、trialTimeout、appReadyStrategy，默认 `off` 时绝不调用 trial；严格校验尺寸/范围并分别接 launch 与 `newContext`。D1 再加预动作 expected-capture-sha 门，proof 以闭合、版本化环境块绑定 profile；E-A/B/C/D 每次只改一个字段。
1258:- [高] [plan.md:14](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-raw-actionability-closure/plan.md:14)、[plan.md:21](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-raw-actionability-closure/plan.md:21)：边车 v2 的生产接线、保留策略与换签账漏列。`teachin-raw-replay` 当前既不创建 ALS collector，也不导入 output/write sidecar，[teachin-raw-replay.mjs:6](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/bin/teachin-raw-replay.mjs:6)；若按 D5 补入写盘，现役 75 钉明确要求 output 的全仓唯一 importer 必须是 `bin/record.mjs`，[teachin-cycle-evidence.zero-sut.golden.mjs:1477](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/tests/_golden/teachin-cycle-evidence.zero-sut.golden.mjs:1477)，该金牌又被 checksum 冻结，[prd-teachin-cycle-evidence.json:5](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/loop/prd-teachin-cycle-evidence.json:5)。此外文件名只含 capture digest，[cycle-evidence-output.mjs:171](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/cycle-evidence-output.mjs:171)，四个环境实验写同目录会相互覆盖。咨询卷原本明确要求 D8 列 reader 策略、profile digest 与重签清单，[actionability-consult-sol-max.log:13218](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/actionability-consult-sol-max.log:13218)，本版遗漏。修法：恢复 D8；规定 v1 是显式拒读还是双版本只读、历史文件不得被 v2 静默覆盖；每个实验用独立目录或 profile digest 定名。按当前设计，至少需修改并重签“75 钉金牌＋`prd-teachin-cycle-evidence`”这一笔旧账，再签新契约；若改动直接冻结的 action-authority/raw-runner/runtime-bootstrap 测试，则还涉及 `prd-teachin-replayability-closure`；若改 clear-fill driver double，再加 `prd-teachin-clear-fill-admission`。即旧 PRD 换签量最低 1 笔、可能 3 笔，不能只写“新金牌冻结人签”。
